OL,3,GNEWSATown 'should act early' to cash in
OL,4,Aon theme park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Bedfordshire town should not wait
OL,7,Funtil the new Universal UK Resort opens
OL,8,Fbefore taking advantage of the
OL,9,Fopportunities it could bring, a report
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FThe report for Biggleswade Town Council
OL,13,Fsaid the park should "bring multiple
OL,14,Fpositive and wellbeing outcomes" for
OL,15,Fthe surrounding area.
OL,17,FThe council's community development
OL,18,Fmanager suggested advertising at the
OL,19,Fpark to "showcase the town's strengths"
OL,20,Fas well as increasing the amount of
OL,21,Frooms available in the town for
OL,22,Fvisitors to stay in.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
